# genATP environment template.
#
# Copy to `.env` at the repo root (`cp .env.example .env`) and edit. The
# `.env` file is gitignored. genATP itself does not load this file
# automatically — source it in your shell, or use `direnv` (see
# docs/CONFIGURATION.md).
#
# All variables are OPTIONAL. With nothing set, genATP defaults to a
# local Ollama daemon at http://127.0.0.1:11434.

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Provider selection
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Force a specific backend. One of: anthropic, openai, nim, ollama.
# Leave unset to auto-detect from whichever credentials are present.
#GENATP_LLM_PROVIDER=ollama

# Override the default model id for the selected provider.
# Defaults: claude-3-5-sonnet-latest / gpt-4o-mini /
# qwen/qwen3-coder-480b-a35b-instruct / llama3.1:8b
#GENATP_LLM_MODEL=

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Anthropic (Claude)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OpenAI
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com
#OPENAI_ORG=

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NVIDIA NIM (OpenAI-compatible)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Use any of the chat models from https://build.nvidia.com that supports
# tool calling. Recommended starters:
#   - qwen/qwen3-coder-480b-a35b-instruct   (purpose-built for browser/agentic)
#   - mistralai/mistral-nemotron            (function calling)
#   - stepfun-ai/step-3.5-flash             (agentic reasoning)
#
# To use NIM, set NVIDIA_API_KEY (preferred) — the factory will reuse the
# OpenAI adapter against integrate.api.nvidia.com automatically.
#NVIDIA_API_KEY=nvapi-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# Override only if NVIDIA changes their endpoint.
#OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://integrate.api.nvidia.com

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ollama (local)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Default base URL. Override if you run Ollama on a different host/port.
#OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Browser / runtime
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Absolute path to Chrome/Chromium. Only needed if `chromiumoxide`
# cannot find it on its own (set by tests on CI runners).
#CHROME_PATH=/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome

# Persistent user-data directory for `genatp serve --user-data-dir …`.
# Set this if you want cookies/localStorage to survive across runs.
#GENATP_USER_DATA_DIR=~/.genatp/profile

# Standard Rust logging — `warn`, `info`, `debug`, `trace`.
#RUST_LOG=warn

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tests (opt-in live tests)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set OLLAMA_LIVE=1 (and `cargo test … -- --ignored`) to exercise the
# end-to-end form-fill against a real local Ollama server.
#OLLAMA_LIVE=
#OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3.1:8b
